  "why": "it is the only route with a keyword branch, and reading it means reproducing the route's text scoping. brief_source_priority puts the item code first and a primary-document heading second; a scan over every document in the accession matches 'transaction' in almost any exhibit, which over-counts. Six of the seven windows hold an 8.01 filing, so E01 is accepted only for the one that does not."
